<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Rich Venneth Lopez Junio | Virtual Assistant &amp; Non-Voice Email Support</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-base: #0b1120;
      --bg-slate: #111827;
      --surface: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.72);
      --surface-solid: #1e293b;
      --surface-hover: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.85);
      --text-main: #f1f5f9;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --text-soft: #cbd5e1;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --accent-soft: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.14);
      --accent-border: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
      --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);
      --shadow: 0 20px 45px -15px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.75);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-base);
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 8%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.13) 0%, transparent 38%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 24%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.11) 0%, transparent 42%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 82%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.09) 0%, transparent 48%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1120 0%, #0f172a 50%, #0b1120 100%);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.65;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(to right, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 44px 44px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .page-wrap {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1040px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Navigation Bar */
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(11, 17, 32, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      height: 72px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.4px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .brand-dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      list-style: none;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      padding: 72px 0 56px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 0.65fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .availability-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .pulse {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #34d399;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px #34d399;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.14;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    h1 span {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f8fafc 15%, #38bdf8 95%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-role {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero-desc {
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 13px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.22s ease;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8, #0284c7);
      color: #08101e;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -8px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.55);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px -6px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.7);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--text-main);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: var(--surface-hover);
      border-color: var(--accent-border);
    }

    /* Profile Card on Right */
    .profile-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px 22px;
      text-align: center;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .avatar-ring {
      width: 148px;
      height: 148px;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      padding: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8, #334155);
      position: relative;
    }

    .avatar-inner {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #1e293b;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .avatar-inner img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center top;
      display: block;
    }

    .profile-name {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .profile-loc {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .profile-badges {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .mini-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-soft);
    }

    /* Quantitative Impact Metrics */
    .metrics-section {
      padding: 20px 0 56px;
    }

    .metrics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .metric-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px 20px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .metric-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--accent-border);
    }

    .metric-num {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent);
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .metric-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .metric-sub {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    /* Section Headers */
    section.content-sec {
      padding: 56px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .sec-kicker {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.4px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .sec-lead {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    /* Services Cards */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .service-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 26px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      transition: all 0.22s ease;
    }

    .service-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent-border);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .icon-box {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .service-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .service-card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    /* Experience Timeline */
    .exp-stack {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .exp-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 26px 28px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .exp-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .exp-role {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .exp-org {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .exp-period {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-soft);
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .exp-bullets {
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 0.93rem;
    }

    .exp-bullets li {
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    /* Tech Stack & Tools */
    .tools-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .tool-chip {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 9px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .tool-chip:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Client Statements Carousel */
    .carousel-shell {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      position: relative;
    }

    .quote-mark {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--accent);
      opacity: 0.45;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .slide {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeSlide 0.35s ease;
    }

    .slide.active {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeSlide {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .client-quote {
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .client-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .client-avatar {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #334155);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .client-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .client-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .carousel-controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .dots {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #475569;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.25s;
    }

    .dot.active {
      width: 28px;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .nav-btns {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .c-btn {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .c-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Call to Action & Contact Section */
    .cta-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.92), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96));
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 44px 36px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .cta-box h2 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .cta-box p {
      color: var(--text-soft);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .contact-list {
      background: rgba(11, 17, 32, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .contact-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .contact-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .contact-val {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-main);
      text-decoration: none;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .contact-val:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .copy-toast {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #34d399;
      margin-top: 8px;
      min-height: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 0 40px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .hero, .cta-box {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .metrics-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .services-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      .metrics-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-wrap">

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header>
      <div class="container nav">
        <a href="#" class="brand">
          <span class="brand-dot"></span>
          Rich Venneth Junio
        </a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="#impact">Impact</a></li>
          <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
          <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
          <li><a href="#testimonials">Client Feedback</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Hire Me</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">

      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <div class="availability-pill">
            <span class="pulse"></span>
            Available Now • Non-Voice Email CSR &amp; Virtual Assistant
          </div>
          <h1><span>Rich Venneth Lopez Junio</span></h1>
          <div class="hero-role">Dedicated Virtual Assistant &amp; Non-Voice Email Support Specialist</div>
          <p class="hero-desc">
            Detail-oriented remote professional specializing in high-volume inbox management, non-voice email customer support, confidential record handling, and SOP-driven daily operations[cite: 1]. I keep customer queues clean, accurate, and fast—so you can focus on growth.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="mailto:Richvenneth@outlook.com?subject=Remote%20VA%20%2F%20Email%20Support%20Opportunity" class="btn btn-primary">
              Hire Me via Email
            </a>
            <a href="#testimonials" class="btn btn-secondary">
              Read Client Statements
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Profile Summary Card -->
        <aside class="profile-card">
          <div class="avatar-ring">
            <div class="avatar-inner">
              <span id="initialsFallback">RV</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="profile-name">Rich Venneth Lopez Junio</div>
          <div class="profile-loc">Ambatali, Ramon, Isabela[cite: 1] • Remote Ready</div>
          <div class="profile-badges">
            <span class="mini-badge">Non-Voice Email</span>
            <span class="mini-badge">MS Outlook</span>
            <span class="mini-badge">100% NDA / Privacy</span>
            <span class="mini-badge">Data Integrity</span>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <!-- Quantitative Impact Section -->
      <section id="impact" class="metrics-section">
        <div class="metrics-grid">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-num">30%</div>
            <div class="metric-title">Faster Response Time</div>
            <div class="metric-sub">Improved email &amp; communication turnaround using structured inbox workflows[cite: 1].</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-num">100%</div>
            <div class="metric-title">Deadline &amp; Privacy Compliance</div>
            <div class="metric-sub">Zero missed action items and strict confidentiality on sensitive financial data[cite: 1].</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-num">99%</div>
            <div class="metric-title">Data &amp; QA Accuracy</div>
            <div class="metric-sub">Verified across 5,000+ digital records with zero reported data entry errors[cite: 1, 2].</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-num">20%</div>
            <div class="metric-title">Admin Workload Reduced</div>
            <div class="metric-sub">Saved client hours weekly through proactive file organization &amp; SOP tracking[cite: 1].</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Core Services -->
      <section id="services" class="content-sec">
        <div class="sec-kicker">What I Bring to Your Team</div>
        <h2>Non-Voice CSR &amp; Executive VA Services</h2>
        <p class="sec-lead">Reliable written communication and structured back-office execution tailored for busy founders and support teams.</p>

        <div class="services-grid">
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="icon-box">@</div>
            <h3>Non-Voice Email Support</h3>
            <p>End-to-end inbox triage, clear and empathetic written responses, ticket categorization, and rapid follow-ups in Microsoft Outlook and helpdesk platforms.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="icon-box">#</div>
            <h3>Confidential Admin &amp; Finance Ops</h3>
            <p>Secure handling of sensitive personal and financial records, transaction tracking via Revolut Business, credential protection, and strict SOP compliance[cite: 1].</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="icon-box">&#10003;</div>
            <h3>Data Entry &amp; Digital Filing</h3>
            <p>High-accuracy spreadsheet updates, quality assurance checks, systematic cloud file indexing, and action-item tracking with zero data errors[cite: 1].</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Work Experience -->
      <section id="experience" class="content-sec">
        <div class="sec-kicker">Track Record</div>
        <h2>Professional Experience</h2>
        <p class="sec-lead">Proven reliability across remote executive assistance, government records, and high-volume customer service.</p>

        <div class="exp-stack">
          <div class="exp-card">
            <div class="exp-header">
              <div>
                <div class="exp-role">Virtual Assistant (Remote)</div>
                <div class="exp-org">Private Client[cite: 1]</div>
              </div>
              <div class="exp-period">December 2025 – September 2026[cite: 1]</div>
            </div>
            <ul class="exp-bullets">
              <li>Managed client accounts and sensitive financial/personal records with 100% confidentiality and strict privacy compliance[cite: 1].</li>
              <li>Operated Microsoft Outlook, Linkensphere, Geelard, and Revolut Business to streamline inboxes, track finances, and accelerate response turnaround by 30%[cite: 1].</li>
              <li>Executed accurate data entry and digital filing with zero reported errors, reducing client administrative workload by 20%[cite: 1].</li>
              <li>Tracked daily tasks and action items to ensure 100% on-time deadline completion[cite: 1].</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-card">
            <div class="exp-header">
              <div>
                <div class="exp-role">Administrative &amp; Records Intern (GIP)[cite: 2]</div>
                <div class="exp-org">Civil Registrar Office[cite: 2]</div>
              </div>
              <div class="exp-period">September 2023 – December 2023[cite: 2]</div>
            </div>
            <ul class="exp-bullets">
              <li>Assisted 30+ clients daily by resolving inquiries and guiding them through civil registry and documentation requirements[cite: 2].</li>
              <li>Digitized, verified, and indexed hundreds of official records under strict government confidentiality standards[cite: 2].</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

